# Generated map vector/raster assets are heavy (current SVGs inline the relief ~19MB) and regenerable.
# Phase 0 slims them (external relief) + serves from R2; the small transform.json stays tracked.
FestPilot/web/public/maps/*.svg
FestPilot/web/public/maps/*.png

